### Tasjeel API walkthrough: open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request".
### Start the server first:  cds watch
### Mock users (no passwords): vendor1, vendor2 (Applicant) · reviewer (Reviewer) · admin (Admin + Reviewer)

@host = http://localhost:4004
@vendor = vendor2:
@reviewer = reviewer:

### 1. Supplier: create a draft (copy the returned ID into @id below)
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/applicant/Applications
Authorization: Basic {{vendor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
@id = paste-the-ID-here

### 2. Autosave: PATCH the draft (Arabic-Indic digits and spaces get normalized, bank detected from IBAN)
PATCH {{host}}/odata/v4/applicant/Applications(ID={{id}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: Basic {{vendor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "legalNameEn": "Ofuq Engineering Co.", "unifiedNo": "٧٠٥٥٥٥٥٥٥٥", "iban": "SA03 8000 0000 6080 1016 7519" }

### 3. What's still needed (in Arabic)
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/applicant/Applications(ID={{id}},IsActiveEntity=false)/ApplicantService.requirements()
Authorization: Basic {{vendor}}
Accept-Language: ar

### 4. Try to activate: 400 with one error per field, each with a "target"
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/applicant/Applications(ID={{id}},IsActiveEntity=false)/ApplicantService.draftActivate
Authorization: Basic {{vendor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. IBAN lookup while typing
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/applicant/lookupIban(iban='SA0380000000608010167519')
Authorization: Basic {{vendor}}
Accept-Language: ar

### 6. Reviewer queue: newest first, with status names and count
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/review/Applications?$select=applicationNo,legalNameEn,riskLevel,submittedAt&$expand=status($select=name)&$orderby=submittedAt desc&$top=10&$count=true
Authorization: Basic {{reviewer}}

### 7. Search the queue by name or unified number
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/review/Applications?$filter=contains(legalNameEn,'Najd') or unifiedNo eq '7012345678'&$select=applicationNo,legalNameEn
Authorization: Basic {{reviewer}}

### 8. Reviewer actions on an application (replace the ID)
POST {{host}}/odata/v4/review/Applications(8293e5d9-aeca-fbcd-9ab4-ca1669f8e977)/ReviewService.requestChanges
Authorization: Basic {{reviewer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Please upload a valid GOSI certificate.", "fields": ["gosiNo"] }

### 9. Duplicate check (same unified number / VAT / IBAN)
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/review/Applications(8293e5d9-aeca-fbcd-9ab4-ca1669f8e977)/ReviewService.duplicates()
Authorization: Basic {{reviewer}}

### 10. Dashboard numbers (plain REST)
GET {{host}}/rest/stats/summary
Authorization: Basic {{reviewer}}

###
GET {{host}}/rest/stats/byCategory
Authorization: Basic {{reviewer}}
Accept-Language: ar

### 11. Security check: a supplier calling the reviewer API → 403
GET {{host}}/odata/v4/review/Applications
Authorization: Basic {{vendor}}
